ven food to those who fear him.","poem":1},{"text":"י He always remembers his covenant ·binding contract between two or more parties·.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"כּ He has shown his people the power of his works,","poem":1},{"text":"ל in giving them the heritage of the nations.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"מ The works of his hands are truth and mishpat ·justice·.","poem":1},{"text":"נ All his precepts are sure.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"ס They are established forever and ever.","poem":1},{"text":"ע They are done in truth and uprightness.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"פּ He has sent redemption to his people.","poem":1},{"text":"צ He has enjoined his covenant forever.","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ק His name is holy","poem":2},{"noteId":232},{"text":"and awesome!","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"ר The fear of Adonai is the beginning of wisdom.","poem":1},{"text":"שׂ All those who do his work have a good understanding.","poem":2},{"text":"תּ His tehilah ·praise song· endures forever!","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":231,"caller":"+","text":". Quoted in  James 5:11","reference":{"chapter":111,"verse":4}},{"noteId":232,"caller":"+","text":". Quoted in  Luke 1:49","reference":{"chapter":111,"verse":9}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/eng_our/PSA/111.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_our/PSA/112.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_our/PSA/110.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}